Object-storage utils

USAGE:
  scw object <command>

AVAILABLE COMMANDS:
  bucket           Manage S3 buckets
  bucket-cors      Manage S3 bucket CORS
  bucket-lifecycle Manage S3 buckets' lifecycle configuration
  bucket-policy    Manage S3 bucket policies
  config           Manage configuration files for popular S3 tools

FLAGS:
  -h, --help[=true|false]                help for object
      --list-sub-commands[=true|false]   List all subcommands

GLOBAL FLAGS:
  -B, --beta[=true|false]         Enable beta mode
  -c, --config string             The path to the config file
  -D, --debug[=true|false]        Enable debug mode
  -H, --no-headers[=true|false]   Skip headers in human output
  -o, --output string             Output format: json or human, see 'scw help output' for more info (default "human")
  -p, --profile string            The config profile to use

Use "scw object [command] --help" for more information about a command.
